    <briefdescription>
<para>UDP packet. </para>    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Works as an allocator, allowing to fill its body gradually, while preserving prefix for metadata. <verbatim>     &lt; - - - -MAX_PACKET_SIZE- - - - -&gt;
     +--------+-----------------------+
     |  meta  |    body    |  *free*  |
     +--------+-----------------------+
     ^        ^            ^          ^
    meta     body         pos        end
    buf</verbatim> </para>    </detaileddescription>
